+/* ============================================================================
+ * Touch controls (portrait)
+ *
+ * In portrait windows the game image is anchored to the top and the area below
+ * it hosts an on-screen D-pad, A/B, Select/Start, plus Rewind, Fast Forward and
+ * Menu buttons. Fingers are tracked by SDL finger id so multi-touch works;
+ * a finger that lands on the D-pad keeps steering it until released, other
+ * fingers may slide between buttons. Mouse events SDL synthesizes from touch
